{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113859","id":3090433102,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc64NERO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113859","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113859.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113859.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113859","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113859/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113859/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113859/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d134fcfa4cae722e5403642b5ce07bcc7c7dd78a","number":113859,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix non-scene Resources \"Save as\"","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #30444\r\n\r\nThis long time issue seems to be coming from a oversight. For some reason, in `editor/editor_node.cpp:1722`, we check if the target resource to save as is the same as the current edited scene. If not, we deny the save as and show a popup.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d743736f84fb668bcdfb5bf86258e483f35c6fec/editor/editor_node.cpp#L1719-L1726\r\n\r\nBut another part of the code has the same check, but checks also if the target resource is of type `PackedScene` (which makes more sense).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d743736f84fb668bcdfb5bf86258e483f35c6fec/editor/editor_node.cpp#L3072-L3074\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the same `PackedScene` check to the save as command. Saving resources don't depend on the edited scene, especially for resources that aren't related to scenes at all.\r\n\r\nThis PR also cleans up the `EditorNode::save_resource_as()` method.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/f